Package: outlog
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, sqlite3
Description: Command-line execution logger
 Outlog is a shell supervisor and command wrapper that automatically
 captures and logs every command executed in the terminal into a
 local SQLite database for searching and auditing.
